{"number":1,"nameArabic":"الفاتحة","nameTransliterated":"Al-Fatihah","nameTranslated":"The Opener","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":7,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"1:1","textAr":"بِسۡمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","transliteration":"Bismi Allahi alrrahmani alrraheemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In the name of Allah, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اللہ کے نام سے جو رحمان و رحیم ہے"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"1:2","textAr":"ٱلۡحَمۡدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"Alhamdu lillahi rabbi alAAalameena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[All] praise is [due] to Allah, Lord of the worlds"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تعریف اللہ ہی کے لیے ہے جو تمام کائنات کا رب ہے"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"1:3","textAr":"ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","transliteration":"Alrrahmani alrraheemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"رحمان اور رحیم ہے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"1:4","textAr":"مَٰلِكِ يَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Maliki yawmi alddeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Sovereign of the Day of Recompense"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"روز جزا کا مالک ہے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"1:5","textAr":"إِيَّاكَ نَعۡبُدُ وَإِيَّاكَ نَسۡتَعِينُ","transliteration":"Iyyaka naAAbudu waiyyaka nastaAAeenu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It is You we worship and You we ask for help"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم تیری ہی عبادت کرتے ہیں اور تجھی سے مدد مانگتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"1:6","textAr":"ٱهۡدِنَا ٱلصِّرَٰطَ ٱلۡمُسۡتَقِيمَ","transliteration":"Ihdina alssirata almustaqeema","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Guide us to the straight path"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہمیں سیدھا راستہ دکھا"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"1:7","textAr":"صِرَٰطَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَنۡعَمۡتَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ غَيۡرِ ٱلۡمَغۡضُوبِ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وَلَا ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","transliteration":"Sirata allatheena anAAamta AAalayhim ghayri almaghdoobi AAalayhim wala alddalleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The path of those upon whom You have bestowed favor, not of those who have evoked [Your] anger or of those who are astray"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُن لوگوں کا راستہ جن پر تو نے انعام فرمایا، جو معتوب نہیں ہوئے، جو بھٹکے ہوئے نہیں ہیں"}]}]}